{"diagnosis": "Fetch fails with TRAP and FAIL 0xdead because mem_rdata_latched decodes stale data as illegal. During mem_xfer line 384 selects mem_rdata_q (previous cycle) instead of live mem_rdata, and when idle selects live mem_rdata instead of held q. Root cause is inverted ternary branches on (mem_xfer || LATCHED_MEM_RDATA) at line 384.", "patch_diff": "diff --git a/picorv32.v b/picorv32.v
--- a/picorv32.v
+++ b/picorv32.v
@@ -382,7 +382,7 @@
 	assign mem_la_addr = (mem_do_prefetch || mem_do_rinst) ? {next_pc[31:2] + mem_la_firstword_xfer, 2'b00} : {reg_op1[31:2], 2'b00};

-	assign mem_rdata_latched_noshuffle = (mem_xfer || LATCHED_MEM_RDATA) ? mem_rdata_q : mem_rdata;
+	assign mem_rdata_latched_noshuffle = (mem_xfer || LATCHED_MEM_RDATA) ? mem_rdata : mem_rdata_q;

 	assign mem_rdata_latched = COMPRESSED_ISA && mem_la_use_prefetched_high_word ? {16'bx, mem_16bit_buffer} :
", "expected": "tohost PASS (not FAIL 0xdead), TRAP deasserted, fetch progress without trap; checksum != c2a7a4d6295484feeb9ec1ea9381732b8e39a7ccd1997c7d70f6454da2fb4659"}

